{"ref":"BDB, אַכְזָרִי","hw":"אַכְזָרִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אַכְזָרִי</span></big>  <strong>adj. cruel</strong>, always in this form;—<a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.10\">Pr 12:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 17:11\" href=\"/Proverbs.17.11\">17:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 6:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.6.23\">Je 6:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 50:42\" href=\"/Jeremiah.50.42\">50:42</a>, also <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:14\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.14\">30:14</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּסָר א׳</span>, for MT <span dir=\"rtl\">מוּסַר</span>, Gf Gie); as subst. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:9\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.9\">Pr 5:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.17\">11:17</a>, perhaps also, in appos. with <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם י׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.9\">Is 13:9</a>.","next":"BDB, אַכְזְרִיּוּת","prev":"BDB, אַכְזָר²"}